4458740/extras/c8674b8d3952cddc9e91ed82529f64bc.poster.avif?t=1784767581\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458740/extras/c8674b8d3952cddc9e91ed82529f64bc.webm?t=1784767581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458740/extras/c8674b8d3952cddc9e91ed82529f64bc.mp4?t=1784767581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every group reacts to your actions, not your words. They remember what you promised and compare promises to results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458740/extras/64a6deab2ba638cbdfa0666cfea2e0f1.poster.avif?t=1784767581\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458740/extras/64a6deab2ba638cbdfa0666cfea2e0f1.webm?t=1784767581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458740/extras/64a6deab2ba638cbdfa0666cfea2e0f1.mp4?t=1784767581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458740/extras/8d2650afd054d67a168d834154811997.avif?t=1784767581\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458740/extras_big/8d2650afd054d67a168d834154811997.webp?t=1784767581 width=1560 height=82 /></span>PODER is not propaganda. The game won't tell you which ideology is best. Privatize everything or nationalize it. Play by the rules or play dirty. Build your career honestly or climb over others. The game only shows what happens next. Sometimes immediately. Sometimes much later, when you've already forgotten how it all started. The most effective path isn't always the most honest one. And the most honest one sometimes leads to failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458740/extras/0434ac361af0094e98c785541bc09f08.poster.avif?t=1784767581\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458740/extras/0434ac361af0094e98c785541bc09f08.webm?t=1784767581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458740/extras/0434ac361af0094e98c785541bc09f08.mp4?t=1784767581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458740/extras/37761418aaa757c1829d963f96be2e09.avif?t=1784767581\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458740/extras_big/37761418aaa757c1829d963f96be2e09.webp?t=1784767581 width=1560 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The district is just the beginning. Manage it well, and new opportunities open up. But with every promotion, decisions get more expensive and enemies multiply. Everyone is sure they could do better than a real politician. PODER doesn't argue, it lets you try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458740/extras/18d4270a03584703bb94a0504573501c.avif?t=1784767581\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458740/extras_big/18d4270a03584703bb94a0504573501c.webp?t=1784767581 wid